      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 922,
        "name": "杏仁豆腐",
        "desc": "杏仁磨浆制成的甜品。有着嫩滑香甜的独特口感和浓郁绵长的杏仁香味，因形似豆腐而得名。",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/10/88072335/8203333dfe466c899142c359a199ddc2_3268475118792863566.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 524,
        "name": "奇怪的杏仁豆腐",
        "desc": "杏仁磨浆制成的甜品。未将杏仁奶浆磨细便草草冷冻，只能欺骗自己颗粒感也属一大特色。",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/10/88072335/f9ba64ba13a588bfee38b4364a73e03c_2283999830760734448.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1407,
        "name": "美味的杏仁豆腐",
        "desc": "杏仁磨浆制成的甜品。形态玲珑，色如凝脂，如同名匠打造的艺术臻品，令人只愿观赏，不忍下口。",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/10/88072335/e38fecf1eb59f5ec4dae652894ce13a0_8443428655866256213.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 159,
        "name": "「美梦」",
        "desc": "魈的特色料理。他的「美梦」很简单，不过是做一个美梦而已。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/\"Sweet Dream\"_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
